## Executive Summary

NexaTech Solutions Inc. is a mid-sized enterprise software company specializing in cloud-based business intelligence and data analytics platforms. Founded in January 2021, the company has grown from a startup of 15 employees to a thriving organization of 500 professionals serving over 2,000 enterprise clients across North America, Europe, and Asia-Pacific regions.

