## Products & Services

### Core Products

**NexaInsight Platform** - Our flagship cloud-based business intelligence platform featuring:
- Real-time data visualization and dashboards
- AI-powered predictive analytics
- Natural language query interface
- Multi-source data integration
- Mobile and web accessibility

**NexaFlow** - Automated workflow and process optimization tool
- Drag-and-drop workflow designer
- Integration with 200+ business applications
- Advanced automation rules engine

**NexaSecure** - Enterprise data governance and security suite
- Role-based access control
- Data encryption and compliance management
- Audit trail and monitoring capabilities

### Professional Services

- Implementation and integration services
- Custom analytics development
- Training and certification programs
- 24/7 technical support and maintenance
- Strategic consulting services

